		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Bright pink tree covered in plump, round fruit. Heady, intoxicating smell.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 53, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +7 (3d6) and hallucinations and hope theft, <strong>MV</strong> close, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +5, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Hallucinations</strong>. Mortals in double near of tree or who eat fruit, WIS 15+ or have pleasant visions for 1d10 rounds, seek to eat fruit and protect tree.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hope Theft</strong>. One mortal within double near of tree who has eaten tree's fruit, WIS 15+ or permanently charmed by tree, forgetting all memories and desires. Seeks to protect tree.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
